# Physical mods (lctl) - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_lctl.kbd)
**lctl + tab**      -- Walk Through Apps
**lctl + `**        -- Walk Through Same App
**lctl + b**        -- Page Up
**lctl + f**        -- Page Down
**lctl + t**        -- New Tab (A-C-t)
**lctl + ,**        -- Setting
**lctl + ;**        -- Vimola (C-A-M-e [50ms] ;)
**lctl + [**        -- Forward (C-A-right)
**lctl + ]**        -- Backward (C-A-left)
**lctl + lsft + t** -- Undo Close Tab (A-C-S-t)
